# Original Programming Language Toggle exercise

This folder preserves the React exercise by **Phathutshedzo Rakhunwana** that started CodeForge. It demonstrates sharing a language preference with React state and context.

The current CodeForge application runs from the repository root. Use the [main README](../README.md) for installation, development, hosting and feature status. This folder has a separate package manifest and is retained as the original exercise, not a second deployment of CodeForge.

[Current repository](https://github.com/Phathu87/code-forge)
